  "Smart Transitions": "智能过渡",
  "Smart Transitions: songs from the same album play gapless, crossfades start where a song's ending actually fades out, and silence at the start and end is skipped. Beat-Matched Crossfades (needs Crossfade on): the next song's tempo is matched and its beats lined up during the fade, then it eases back to normal speed. Harmonic Shuffle: Smart shuffle plays songs in compatible keys and similar tempos next to each other. Songs that haven't been analyzed, or have no steady beat, use normal transitions.": "智能过渡：同一专辑的歌曲无缝衔接，淡入淡出从歌曲结尾真正开始渐弱的地方开始，并跳过开头和结尾的静音。节拍匹配淡入淡出（需开启淡入淡出）：淡入淡出时会匹配下一首歌曲的速度并对齐节拍，之后再平滑恢复正常速度。和声随机播放：智能随机播放会把调性相容、速度相近的歌曲排在一起。未分析或没有稳定节拍的歌曲使用普通过渡。",
